{"time":"2026-05-22 20:34:18","level":"WARN","msg":"claudecli: user event received","project":"Super-Dolphin","line":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_8XIs6AZl4cl3zZ1KcnahgIpw\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"{\\\"value\\\":\\\" 1: # 07 业务模块层代码地图（拆卷索引）\\\\n 2: \\\\n 3: > 扫描范围：`internal/module/dashboard/`、`skill/`、`thread/`、`turn/`、`uistate/`；`internal/module/lspgui/` 当前在仓内无源码目录。  \\\\n 4: > 2026-04-20 起按 **读侧 / 写侧** 拆卷；本页只保留导航、边界与总览，避免单文件继续超过 600 行。\\\\n 5: \\\\n 6: ---\\\\n 7: \\\\n 8: ## 1. 阅读顺序\\\\n 9: \\\\n10: | 子卷 | 文件 | 覆盖范围 |\\\\n11: |---|---|---|\\\\n12: | 07A（读侧） | [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) | `dashboard` / `lspgui`（现状核对）/ `skill` |\\\\n13: | 07B（写侧） | [07-module-write.md](07-module-write.md) | `thread` / `turn` / `uistate` |\\\\n14: \\\\n15: ## 2. 本卷边界\\\\n16: \\\\n17: - **本卷只讲业务模块层**：RPC handler、Fx 装配、服务编排、UI/前端消费面。\\\\n18: - **第 11 卷承接 prompt / memory 主链**：`internal/module/prompt`、`internal/module/memory` 的内部组装、provider bridge、snapshot 语义仍以第 11 卷为准。\\\\n19: - **lspgui 现状以代码真值为准**：当前仓内不存在 `internal/module/lspgui/`，因此 07A 只保留“历史章节失真”说明，不再虚构文件地图。\\\\n20: \\\\n21: ## 3. 模块总览\\\\n22: \\\\n23: ```mermaid\\\\n24: flowchart LR\\\\n25:     RPC[RPC / Frontend / Orchestration] --> MOD[internal/module/*]\\\\n26:     MOD --> DASH[dashboard\\\\\\\\n读模型聚合]\\\\n27:     MOD --> SKILL[skill\\\\\\\\n技能扫描/渐进披露/本地 FS]\\\\n28:     MOD --> THREAD[thread\\\\\\\\n线程生命周期]\\\\n29:     MOD --> TURN[turn\\\\\\\\n回合编排]\\\\n30:     MOD --> UISTATE[uistate\\\\\\\\nUI 投影]\\\\n31:     MOD --> LSPGUI[lspgui\\\\\\\\n当前仓内缺失]\\\\n32:     DASH --> STORE[(stores)]\\\\n33:     SKILL --> FS[(skills roots)]\\\\n34:     THREAD --> CONTRACT[contract + store + provider]\\\\n35:     TURN --> CONTRACT\\\\n36:     UISTATE --> BUS[event bus + stores]\\\\n37: ```\\\\n38: \\\\n39: ## 4. 模块分工速查\\\\n40: \\\\n41: | 模块 | 定位 | 主要消费者 |\\\\n42: |---|---|---|\\\\n43: | `dashboard` | 运维/只读聚合页、日志、DAG、Agent 详情 | Wails/前端、诊断页 |\\\\n44: | `skill` | 本地技能目录、渐进披露、匹配预览、受限命令执行；`Service` 仅保留兼容聚合面 | prompt(`SkillCatalogSource`)、turn(`SkillHydrationSource`)、dashboard(`SkillLister`)、toolbridge(`SkillHostToolReader`)、host RPC |\\\\n45: | `thread` | 线程启动/恢复/fork/归档/配置 | RPC、uistate、turn |\\\\n46: | `turn` | 回合输入组装、启动/打断/强制完成 | RPC、thread、provider |\\\\n47: | `uistate` | UIState / Sidebar / Timeline / Preferences 投影 | Wails 前端 |\\\\n48: | `lspgui` | 历史 GUI-LSP 包；**当前仓内缺失** | — |\\\\n49: \\\\n50: ## 5. 拆卷说明\\\\n51: \\\\n52: - 07A 先把 `dashboard / skill` 按当前代码真值重写，并把 `lspgui` 标注为缺口。\\\\n53: - 07B 预留给 `thread / turn / uistate` 深化；此页仅作为稳定入口，便于 README / 外链继续指向 `07-module.md`。\\\\n54: \\\\n55: ## 6. 拆卷映射表\\\\n56: \\\\n57: | 卷 | 重点章节 | 讲什么 |\\\\n58: |---|---|---|\\\\n59: | [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) | §2、§3、§4、§5 | dashboard 查询聚合、`dashboard/prompts` cwd 过滤、`lspgui` 缺席真值、`skill/list` / provider-native mirror / legacy 技能面 |\\\\n60: | [07-module-write.md](07-module-write.md) | §2、§3、§4、§5 | thread 生命周期、turn 输入组装与执行、uistate 投影、blank-thread `sendMessage` 首发顺序 |\\\\n61: \\\\n62: ## 7. 阅读顺序补充\\\\n63: \\\\n64: 1. 先读 [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §2，确认 dashboard 真相源与查询分发。\\\\n65: 2. 再读 [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §4，确认 skill 目录、`skill/list`、provider-native mirror、legacy RPC 共存面。\\\\n66: 3. 需要线程/回合执行链时，转到 [07-module-write.md](07-module-write.md) §2 → §3 → §4。\\\\n67: 4. 遇到 blank-thread 首发、聊天页技能边界、前后端接缝问题，最后再读 [07-module-write.md](07-module-write.md) §5，并回看 [01-terminal-ui-vue.md](01-terminal-ui-vue.md) §5.1。\\\\n68: \\\\n69: ## 8. 跨卷跳转锚点\\\\n70: \\\\n71: - 看 dashboard cwd 去 [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §2.4。\\\\n72: - 看 `skill/list` / provider-native mirror 去 [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §4.3、§4.4、§4.5。\\\\n73: - 看 blank-thread `startThread -> sendMessage` 去 [07-module-write.md](07-module-write.md) §5，再回 [01-terminal-ui-vue.md](01-terminal-ui-vue.md) §5.1。\\\\n74: - 看 prompt snapshot / memory 注入为什么不在 07 展开，去 [11-memory.md](11-memory.md) §5.5 B；prompt/thread 入口位见 [11-prompt-thread.md](11-prompt-thread.md)。\\\\n75: \\\\n76: ## 9. 最近一次重大变更摘要\\\\n77: \\\\n78: - **2026-04-17**：07 从单卷改成“稳定索引 + 读侧 / 写侧双卷”，本页不再承载正文。\\\\n79: - **2026-04-20**：07A/07B 按当时代码真值重写，补回 `dashboard/prompts` cwd、`skill/list` / `skill/expand`、`lspgui` 缺席、thread/turn/uistate 真链路。\\\\n80: - **2026-05-18**：Skill V1 切到 provider-native mirror 后，`skill/expand` 已退出 host RPC 注册表，文档改按 canonical/mirror 链路描述。\\\\n81: - **2026-04-29**：接口隔离后，`skill.Service` 是兼容聚合接口；跨模块消费改按 `SkillLister` / `SkillCatalogSource` / `SkillHydrationSource` / `SkillHostToolReader` 等窄端口描述。\\\\n82: \\\\n83: ## 10. 常见误导\\\\n84: \\\\n85: - `07-module.md` 现在只是稳定索引页，**不代表业务模块内容少**；真实正文已进 `07-module-read.md` / `07-module-write.md`。\\\\n86: - `dashboard/prompts` 已不是旧版“简单 page-field wrapper”；真实入口是 ctx 带 `cwd` 后再过滤。\\\\n87: - `skill` 不只剩 legacy `skills/*`；host 侧保留 `skill/list`，provider runtime 走 provider-native mirror，跨模块不要再按完整 `skill.Service` 胖接口理解。\\\\n88: - `lspgui` 在当前仓内并不存在；看到旧文档提它时，一律以 `07-module-read.md` §3 为准。\\\\n89: \\\\n90: ## 11. 新增符号入口\\\\n91: \\\\n92: | 符号 / 主题 | 去哪看 |\\\\n93: |---|---|\\\\n94: | `withDashboardPromptScopeCWD` / `dashboard/prompts` | [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §2.4 |\\\\n95: | `filterDashboardPromptsByCWD` / `scope.cwd:<cwd>` | [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §2.4 |\\\\n96: | `skill/list` | [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §4.3、§4.4 |\\\\n97: | provider-native skill mirror / `skill/expand` 退役边界 | [07-module-read.md](07-module-read.md) §4.3、§4.5 |\\\\n98: | `thread/start` / `turn/start` / blank-thread `sendMessage` | [07-module-write.md](07-module-write.md) §2.4 A、§3.4、§5 |\\\\n99: \\\"}\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"12dc6b9d-ae3f-48b7-8896-375977492795\",\"uuid\":\"125d0997-015e-4f8c-935d-653d54e0788b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-22T12:34:18.146Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"content\":\"{\\\"value\\\":\\\" 1: # 07 业务模块层代码地图（拆卷索引）\\\\n 2: \\\\n 3: > 扫描范围：`internal/module/dashboard/`、`skill/`、`thread/`、`turn/`、`uistate/`；`internal/module/lspgui/` 当前在仓内无源码目录。  \\\