{"time":"2026-05-22 20:34:49","level":"WARN","msg":"claudecli: user event received","project":"Super-Dolphin","line":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_wIqPrLpnVFYd3YLHiWFi2ZJg\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"{\\\"value\\\":\\\"  1: # 11B Prompt / Thread 代码地图\\\\n  2: \\\\n  3: > 拆卷说明：本卷只覆盖 `internal/module/prompt/`、`internal/module/thread/`、provider bridge、以及 blank-thread 首发链；memory 深水区另见 [`11-memory.md`](11-memory.md)。\\\\n  4: > 当前口径：以 2026-04-20 HEAD 为准；用于收口 prompt / thread / provider `start / resume / fork`、prompt store、snapshot、以及前端 blank-thread 首发真值。\\\\n  5: > 必读搭配：`docs/会话习惯.md` §10.21 / §10.25；shared patches：`tmp/codemap-missing-coverage.md`、`tmp/codemap-mermaid-patches.md`、`tmp/codemap-test-freeze.md`、`tmp/codemap-howto-patches.md`。\\\\n  6: \\\\n  7: ## 1. 这卷回答什么\\\\n  8: \\\\n  9: - `thread/start` 到 provider `StartSession` 之间，**system prompt 是怎样组装、下发、落盘**的。\\\\n 10: - `PROMPT_START_CURRENT_DATE`、dynamic sections、memory providers、native-tool replacement hints，**分别插在哪个层级**。\\\\n 11: - `thread/resume` / `thread/fork` / `thread/recover` 时，**prompt snapshot 与 runtime config snapshot 各自如何复用**。\\\\n 12: - provider raw event 经过 unified event map、session manager、thread 订阅、eventsurface，**最终怎样变成 UI 可见事件**。\\\\n 13: - blank-thread 首发时，前端为什么一定是 **`resolveStartOptions -> startThread -> sendMessage`** 两段式，而不是一次 RPC 直发。\\\\n 14: \\\\n 15: ## 2. 当前源码结论\\\\n 16: \\\\n 17: 1. **start prompt 的正式入口不在 prompt 包里单独命名，而在 thread helper**：`internal/module/thread/start_session_helpers.go:82-94` 的 `resolveStartPromptAssembly()` 调 `PromptAssemblyRef.AssembleStart()`。\\\\n 18: 2. **turn prompt 没有同名 helper**：仓内 `resolveTurnPromptAssembly` 为 0 命中；turn 侧真实入口是 `internal/module/turn/prompt_assembly.go:13-43` 的 `prepareTurnAssembly()`，再调 `prompt.AssembleTurn()`。\\\\n 19: 3. **`PROMPT_START_CURRENT_DATE` 已上线且只影响 start 一次性 system block**：常量在 `internal/module/prompt/assembler.go:25`，读 env 在 `:289-291`，注入 “Today's date is ...” 在 `:273`。\\\\n 20: 4. **dynamic section 不是固定 5 个 slot**：真实矩阵来自 `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:43-61`，当前不含旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表 slot。\\\\n 21: 5. **skill 不再经 prompt catalog 注入**：V1 生产路径是 canonical skills -> provider-native mirrors；prompt 不从 skill store 读取 native replacement，native/tool suppression hints 只来自用户禁用工具配置。\\\\n 22: 6. **prompt config 不再承载旧 skill 列表开关**：`internal/module/prompt/config.go` 只保留 registry / assembly / system-context cache breaker 等 prompt 开关。\\\\n 23: 7. **prompt store 不是只读**：`internal/store/prompt/contract.go:15-22` 已暴露 `WithTx / Get / Delete / InsertVersion / Upsert`；写路径在 `internal/module/prompt/service.go:290-340,382-488`。\\\\n 24: 8. **freeze 真值是 `prompt = 27`**：`internal/archtest/freeze_registry.go:29-35` 明写 `internal/module/prompt` 包文件数 freeze 到 27。\\\\n 25: 9. **resume 没有独立 `resume.go`**：resume 主链分散在 `thread/lifecycle.go`、`start_session.go`、`prompt_snapshot.go`、`rpc.go`；文件树里只有 `resume_test.go`、`resume_session_uuid_test.go`。\\\\n 26: 10. **memory 与 prompt 的交点不是共用一个 snapshot 结构**：prompt snapshot 单独存 `agent_thread_prompt_snapshot`；memory 侧读的是 thread `ConfigOverride.Runtime`，由 `MemoryLifecycleHooks.resolveThreadRuntimeMetadata()` 解释。\\\\n 27: 11. **provider bridge 的主干是 bus，不是 thread 直接监听 driver**：driver session 只 dispatch raw event；统一翻译发生在 `internal/provider/unified/event_map.go:71-124`；thread 只订阅 bus 上的 typed event。\\\\n 28: 12. **blank-thread 首发天然是两跳**：前端先 `thread/start` 拿 thread id，再 `turn/start` 发用户输入；这保证 start-only prompt 只在创线时注入一次。\\\\n 29: \\\\n 30: ## 3. 文件与入口索引\\\\n 31: \\\\n 32: ### 3.1 Prompt 侧文件图\\\\n 33: \\\\n 34: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 35: |---|---|---|\\\\n 36: | `internal/module/prompt/module.go` | fx 装配、prompt service wiring | `Module`、`NewServiceFx`、`DisabledToolsFn` optional injection |\\\\n 37: | `internal/module/prompt/config.go` | env config | registry / assembly / system-context cache breaker |\\\\n 38: | `internal/module/prompt/service.go` | registry + prompt CRUD service | built-in providers、prompt store 写入口 |\\\\n 39: | `internal/module/prompt/assembler.go` | start/turn assembly 真身 | start system prompt、current date hook、snapshot 生成 |\\\\n 40: | `internal/module/prompt/section.go` | static section specs | static slots 真实列表 |\\\\n 41: | `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go` | dynamic slot 矩阵 | dynamic section specs、slot -> provider 解析 |\\\\n 42: | `internal/module/prompt/registry.go` | ordered section registry | `Sections()` 按 `Order` 输出 |\\\\n 43: \\\\n 44: ### 3.2 Thread 侧文件图\\\\n 45: \\\\n 46: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 47: |---|---|---|\\\\n 48: | `internal/module/thread/contract.go` | service contract / DTO | `StartRequest`、`ResumeRequest`、`PromptSnapshot` 字段 |\\\\n 49: | `internal/module/thread/rpc.go` | `thread/*` RPC handlers | `thread/start`、`thread/resume`、`thread/fork` |\\\\n 50: | `internal/module/thread/lifecycle.go` | `Start / Resume` service 主链 | launch、persist、save prompt snapshot |\\\\n 51: | `internal/module/thread/start_prompt_context.go` | start BuildCtx 组装 | cwd / gitRoot / MCP / session flags 注入 |\\\\n 52: | `internal/module/thread/start_session_helpers.go` | start helper | `resolveStartPromptAssembly`、`buildStartSessionConfig` |\\\\n 53: | `internal/module/thread/start_session.go` | provider DTO 物化 | `StartSession` / `ResumeSession` 请求拼装 |\\\\n 54: | `internal/module/thread/prompt_snapshot.go` | snapshot 持久化与恢复 | hash、load/save、resume/fork fallback |\\\\n 55: | `internal/module/thread/lifecycle_fork.go` | `Fork / Recover` | stable snapshot 继承、resume reuse |\\\\n 56: | `internal/module/thread/factory.go` | offline/runtime config snapshot | `storedThreadConfig` encode/decode |\\\\n 57: | `internal/module/thread/events.go` | thread 订阅 provider lifecycle | `onAgentLaunched`、`onAgentFailed` |\\\\n 58: | `internal/module/thread/module.go` | fx wiring | `registerSubscriptions` |\\\\n 59: \\\\n 60: ### 3.3 Provider bridge 侧文件图\\\\n 61: \\\\n 62: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 63: |---|---|---|\\\\n 64: | `internal/provider/unified/module.go` | unified 总装配 | `EventDispatcher`、`SessionManager`、`Client` |\\\\n 65: | `internal/provider/unified/client.go` | thread 的 `SessionStarter` 适配 | `StartSession` / `ResumeSession` 统一入口 |\\\\n 66: | `internal/provider/unified/session.go` | in-memory session registry | register / generation / close all |\\\\n 67: | `internal/provider/unified/session_resolver.go` | durable binding -> auto resume | app 重启后 session 重建 |\\\\n 68: | `internal/provider/unified/event_map.go` | raw -> typed event 发布 | `typedEventPublishers`、`Dispatch()` |\\\\n 69: | `internal/provider/claudecli/event_map.go` | Claude raw translator | `translateClaudeEvent` |\\\\n 70: | `internal/provider/codexapp/event_map.go` | Codex raw translator | `translateCodexEvent` |\\\\n 71: | `internal/platform/eventsurface/bind.go` | typed event -> RPC/UI method | `thread/started`、`turn/*`、`ui/thread/patch` |\\\\n 72: \\\\n 73: ### 3.4 Frontend blank-thread 文件图\\\\n 74: \\\\n 75: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 76: |---|---|---|\\\\n 77: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/composables/useThreadActions.js` | 首发 send orchestration | `resolveStartOptions()` + `performSend()` |\\\\n 78: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/stores/thread-actions-helpers.js` | `thread/start` / `turn/start` 客户端 | `startThread()`、`sendMessage()` |\\\\n 79: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/components/ComposerBar.js` | composer UI | 输入、附件、发送、停止、压缩与线程配置；不再展示聊天内技能建议 |\\\\n 80: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/pages/UnifiedChatPage.template.js` | chat/workspace 模板 | composer、timeline、diff、task handoff 装配 |\\\\n 81: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/services/skills-api.js` | local skill write/import + resolution RPC | cwd-aware skill 管理、mirror conflict actions |\\\\n 82: \\\\n 83: ### 3.5 三个容易误读的“缺席真值”\\\\n 84: \\\\n 85: | 主题 | 真相 | 锚点 |\\\\n 86: |---|---|---|\\\\n 87: | `resolveTurnPromptAssembly` | 仓内无此符号；真实入口是 `turn.prepareTurnAssembly()` | `lsp_grep internal resolveTurnPromptAssembly = 0`；`internal/module/turn/prompt_assembly.go:13-43` |\\\\n 88: | `resume.go` | thread 包无独立实现文件；resume 逻辑拆在 `rpc.go + lifecycle.go + start_session.go + prompt_snapshot.go` | `find internal/module/thread ...` 文件树；`internal/module/thread/rpc.go:308-333` |\\\\n 89: | 旧独立 skill-catalog fx 文件 | 已删除；当前承载点并入 `prompt/module.go:14-26` | `internal/module/prompt/module.go:14-26` |\\\\n 90: \\\\n 91: ## 4. Prompt 主链\\\\n 92: \\\\n 93: ### 4.1 Prompt 模块装配入口\\\\n 94: \\\\n 95: - `internal/module/prompt/module.go:14-27` 定义 `prompt.Module`。\\\\n 96: - `fx.Provide(...)` 里同时放入：\\\\n 97:   - `NewConfig`\\\\n 98:   - `NewServiceFx`\\\\n 99:   - `AsPromptRegistry`\\\\n100:   - `AsPromptAssemblyService`\\\\n101:   - `AsDynamicSectionRegistrar`\\\\n102:   - `AsSectionInvalidator`\\\\n103:   - `registerPromptHandlers`\\\\n104: - `newPromptClassifier`\\\\n105: - `ServiceFxParams` 当前只接入 prompt config、logger、UI preference store、shared-file reader 和可选 `DisabledToolsFn`；没有 skill store 接线。\\\\n106: - `DisabledToolsFn` 只把用户禁用工具配置传给 prompt assembler，作为 native/tool suppression hints 的当前来源。\\\\n107: - 也就是说，**section slot 的“定义”与 provider 的“注入”是两段式**：\\\\n108:   1. `NewService()` 先注册静态 section + dynamic slot。\\\\n109:   2. 各 provider 再通过 `RegisterDynamicProvider()` 把实现挂到 slot 名上。\\\\n110: \\\\n111: ### 4.2 Registry 与 built-in provider 的组装方式\\\\n112: \\\\n113: - `internal/module/prompt/service.go:118-144` 的 `NewService()` 会：\\\\n114:   - 初始化 `SectionRegistry`\\\\n115:   - 初始化 section cache / userContext cache\\\\n116:   - 调 `registerBuiltInSections()`\\\\n117:   - 用 `mustRegisterDynamicProvider()` 注册 built-in dynamic providers\\\\n118: - `registerBuiltInSections()` 在 `service.go:344-350`：\\\\n119:   - 先注册 `StaticSections()`\\\\n120:   - 再注册 `dynamicSlotSections()`\\\\n121: - `SectionRegistry.Sections()` 在 `internal/module/prompt/registry.go:35-50`：\\\\n122:   - 按 `Order` 排序\\\\n123:   - 同 order 时按 `Name` 排序\\\\n124: - 这意味着：**最终 assembler 看到的是完整有序 section 列表，不是写死在 assembler.go 里的 if/else**。\\\\n125: \\\\n126: ### 4.3 Static sections：固定骨架\\\\n127: \\\\n128: `internal/module/prompt/section.go:24-32` 当前 static matrix 如下：\\\\n129: \\\\n130: | order | name | 说明 |\\\\n131: |---|---|---|\\\\n132: | 10 | `identity` | agent 身份与默认定位 |\\\\n133: | 20 | `system_constraints` | 系统约束 |\\\\n134: | 30 | `engineering` | 工程规则 |\\\\n135: | 40 | `actions` | 动作规范 |\\\\n136: | 50 | `tool_preferences` | 仓库内优先用 LSP / code tools |\\\\n137: | 60 | `style` | 风格约束 |\\\\n138: | 70 | `output_efficiency` | 输出效率约束 |\\\\n139: \\\\n140: 这 7 个 static section 会进入 start assembly。\\\\n141: \\\\n142: ### 4.4 Dynamic sections：真实 slot 矩阵\\\\n143: \\\\n144: `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:43-61` 当前真实 dynamic matrix 如下。\\\\n145: \\\\n146: | order | name | cachePolicy | startOnly | 生产 provider 入口 |\\\\n147: |---|---|---|---|---|\\\\n148: | 110 | `session_guidance` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `SessionGuidanceProvider`，`service.go:131` |\\\\n149: | 120 | `memory` | `InputScoped` | 是 | `MemoryRulesProvider`，memory 模块注册 |\\\\n150: | 122 | `memory_entrypoint` | `InputScoped` | 是 | memory entrypoint provider |\\\\n151: | 125 | `memory_context` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `MemoryContextProvider`，turn lane |\\\\n152: | 130 | `env_info_simple` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `EnvInfoProvider`，`service.go:132` |\\\\n153: | 140 | `language` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `LanguageProvider`，`service.go:133` |\\\\n154: | 150 | `mcp_instructions` | `Uncached` | 否 | `MCPInstructionsProvider`，`service.go:134` |\\\\n155: | 200 | `output_style` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `OutputStyleProvider`，`service.go:135` |\\\\n156: | 210 | `scratchpad` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `ScratchpadProvider`，`service.go:136` |\\\\n157: | 220 | `frc` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `FRCProvider`，`service.go:137` |\\\\n158: | 230 | `summarize_tool_results` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `SummarizeToolResultsProvider`，`service.go:138` |\\\\n159: | 240 | `numeric_length_anchors` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `NumericLengthAnchorsProvider`，`service.go:139` |\\\\n160: | 250 | `token_budget` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `TokenBudgetProvider`，`service.go:140` |\\\\n161: | 260 | `brief` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `BriefProvider`，`service.go:141` |\\\\n162: | 270 | `ant_model_override` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `AntModelOverrideStubProvider`，`service.go` |\\\\n163: \\\\n164: 结论：**这不是“固定 5 个 dynamic slot”**。旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表 slot 已退出生产链，skills 通过 provider-native mirrors 让 Claude/Codex 自己发现。\\\\n165: \\\\n166: ### 4.5 `dynamicSlotSections()` 如何把 slot 变成真正 section\\\\n167: \\\\n168: - `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:333-352` 的 `dynamicSlotSections()` 遍历 `dynamicSectionSpecs`。\\\\n169: - 每个 spec 都被映射成一个 `PromptSection`：\\\\n170:   - `Name = spec.name`\\\\n171:   - `Order = spec.order`\\\\n172:   - `Region = PromptRegionDynamic`\\\\n173:   - `Volatile = spec.cachePolicy == Uncached`\\\\n174:   - `StartOnly = spec.startOnly`\\\\n175:   - `Compute = s.resolveDynamicSection(...)`\\\\n176: - `resolveDynamicSection()` 在 `dynamic.go:355-363`：\\\\n177:   - 只按名字从 `s.dynamic` map 取 provider\\\\n178:   - provider 为 nil 时直接返回 nil\\\\n179: - 所以即使 slot 已存在，只要 provider 没注册，**该 section 仍会渲染为空**。\\\\n180: - 旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表已不在 slot 矩阵内；新增 dynamic provider 仍遵循“slot 注册 + provider 解析”的通用模式。\\\\n\\\\n...[showing lines 1-180 of 1436 total, use offset=181 to continue]\\\"}\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"12dc6b9d-ae3f-48b7-8896-375977492795\",\"uuid\":\"3d2382f4-acfc-46a0-92ba-5c2b10b1557b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-22T12:34:49.063Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"content\":\"{\\\"value\\\":\\\"  1: # 11B Prompt / Thread 代码地图\\\\n  2: \\\\n  3: > 拆卷说明：本卷只覆盖 `internal/module/prompt/`、`internal/module/thread/`、provider bridge、以及 blank-thread 首发链；memory 深水区另见 [`11-memory.md`](11-memory.md)。\\\\n  4: > 当前口径：以 2026-04-20 HEAD 为准；用于收口 prompt / thread / provider `start / resume / fork`、prompt store、snapshot、以及前端 blank-thread 首发真值。\\\\n  5: > 必读搭配：`docs/会话习惯.md` §10.21 / §10.25；shared patches：`tmp/codemap-missing-coverage.md`、`tmp/codemap-mermaid-patches.md`、`tmp/codemap-test-freeze.md`、`tmp/codemap-howto-patches.md`。\\\\n  6: \\\\n  7: ## 1. 这卷回答什么\\\\n  8: \\\\n  9: - `thread/start` 到 provider `StartSession` 之间，**system prompt 是怎样组装、下发、落盘**的。\\\\n 10: - `PROMPT_START_CURRENT_DATE`、dynamic sections、memory providers、native-tool replacement hints，**分别插在哪个层级**。\\\\n 11: - `thread/resume` / `thread/fork` / `thread/recover` 时，**prompt snapshot 与 runtime config snapshot 各自如何复用**。\\\\n 12: - provider raw event 经过 unified event map、session manager、thread 订阅、eventsurface，**最终怎样变成 UI 可见事件**。\\\\n 13: - blank-thread 首发时，前端为什么一定是 **`resolveStartOptions -> startThread -> sendMessage`** 两段式，而不是一次 RPC 直发。\\\\n 14: \\\\n 15: ## 2. 当前源码结论\\\\n 16: \\\\n 17: 1. **start prompt 的正式入口不在 prompt 包里单独命名，而在 thread helper**：`internal/module/thread/start_session_helpers.go:82-94` 的 `resolveStartPromptAssembly()` 调 `PromptAssemblyRef.AssembleStart()`。\\\\n 18: 2. **turn prompt 没有同名 helper**：仓内 `resolveTurnPromptAssembly` 为 0 命中；turn 侧真实入口是 `internal/module/turn/prompt_assembly.go:13-43` 的 `prepareTurnAssembly()`，再调 `prompt.AssembleTurn()`。\\\\n 19: 3. **`PROMPT_START_CURRENT_DATE` 已上线且只影响 start 一次性 system block**：常量在 `internal/module/prompt/assembler.go:25`，读 env 在 `:289-291`，注入 “Today's date is ...” 在 `:273`。\\\\n 20: 4. **dynamic section 不是固定 5 个 slot**：真实矩阵来自 `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:43-61`，当前不含旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表 slot。\\\\n 21: 5. **skill 不再经 prompt catalog 注入**：V1 生产路径是 canonical skills -> provider-native mirrors；prompt 不从 skill store 读取 native replacement，native/tool suppression hints 只来自用户禁用工具配置。\\\\n 22: 6. **prompt config 不再承载旧 skill 列表开关**：`internal/module/prompt/config.go` 只保留 registry / assembly / system-context cache breaker 等 prompt 开关。\\\\n 23: 7. **prompt store 不是只读**：`internal/store/prompt/contract.go:15-22` 已暴露 `WithTx / Get / Delete / InsertVersion / Upsert`；写路径在 `internal/module/prompt/service.go:290-340,382-488`。\\\\n 24: 8. **freeze 真值是 `prompt = 27`**：`internal/archtest/freeze_registry.go:29-35` 明写 `internal/module/prompt` 包文件数 freeze 到 27。\\\\n 25: 9. **resume 没有独立 `resume.go`**：resume 主链分散在 `thread/lifecycle.go`、`start_session.go`、`prompt_snapshot.go`、`rpc.go`；文件树里只有 `resume_test.go`、`resume_session_uuid_test.go`。\\\\n 26: 10. **memory 与 prompt 的交点不是共用一个 snapshot 结构**：prompt snapshot 单独存 `agent_thread_prompt_snapshot`；memory 侧读的是 thread `ConfigOverride.Runtime`，由 `MemoryLifecycleHooks.resolveThreadRuntimeMetadata()` 解释。\\\\n 27: 11. **provider bridge 的主干是 bus，不是 thread 直接监听 driver**：driver session 只 dispatch raw event；统一翻译发生在 `internal/provider/unified/event_map.go:71-124`；thread 只订阅 bus 上的 typed event。\\\\n 28: 12. **blank-thread 首发天然是两跳**：前端先 `thread/start` 拿 thread id，再 `turn/start` 发用户输入；这保证 start-only prompt 只在创线时注入一次。\\\\n 29: \\\\n 30: ## 3. 文件与入口索引\\\\n 31: \\\\n 32: ### 3.1 Prompt 侧文件图\\\\n 33: \\\\n 34: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 35: |---|---|---|\\\\n 36: | `internal/module/prompt/module.go` | fx 装配、prompt service wiring | `Module`、`NewServiceFx`、`DisabledToolsFn` optional injection |\\\\n 37: | `internal/module/prompt/config.go` | env config | registry / assembly / system-context cache breaker |\\\\n 38: | `internal/module/prompt/service.go` | registry + prompt CRUD service | built-in providers、prompt store 写入口 |\\\\n 39: | `internal/module/prompt/assembler.go` | start/turn assembly 真身 | start system prompt、current date hook、snapshot 生成 |\\\\n 40: | `internal/module/prompt/section.go` | static section specs | static slots 真实列表 |\\\\n 41: | `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go` | dynamic slot 矩阵 | dynamic section specs、slot -> provider 解析 |\\\\n 42: | `internal/module/prompt/registry.go` | ordered section registry | `Sections()` 按 `Order` 输出 |\\\\n 43: \\\\n 44: ### 3.2 Thread 侧文件图\\\\n 45: \\\\n 46: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 47: |---|---|---|\\\\n 48: | `internal/module/thread/contract.go` | service contract / DTO | `StartRequest`、`ResumeRequest`、`PromptSnapshot` 字段 |\\\\n 49: | `internal/module/thread/rpc.go` | `thread/*` RPC handlers | `thread/start`、`thread/resume`、`thread/fork` |\\\\n 50: | `internal/module/thread/lifecycle.go` | `Start / Resume` service 主链 | launch、persist、save prompt snapshot |\\\\n 51: | `internal/module/thread/start_prompt_context.go` | start BuildCtx 组装 | cwd / gitRoot / MCP / session flags 注入 |\\\\n 52: | `internal/module/thread/start_session_helpers.go` | start helper | `resolveStartPromptAssembly`、`buildStartSessionConfig` |\\\\n 53: | `internal/module/thread/start_session.go` | provider DTO 物化 | `StartSession` / `ResumeSession` 请求拼装 |\\\\n 54: | `internal/module/thread/prompt_snapshot.go` | snapshot 持久化与恢复 | hash、load/save、resume/fork fallback |\\\\n 55: | `internal/module/thread/lifecycle_fork.go` | `Fork / Recover` | stable snapshot 继承、resume reuse |\\\\n 56: | `internal/module/thread/factory.go` | offline/runtime config snapshot | `storedThreadConfig` encode/decode |\\\\n 57: | `internal/module/thread/events.go` | thread 订阅 provider lifecycle | `onAgentLaunched`、`onAgentFailed` |\\\\n 58: | `internal/module/thread/module.go` | fx wiring | `registerSubscriptions` |\\\\n 59: \\\\n 60: ### 3.3 Provider bridge 侧文件图\\\\n 61: \\\\n 62: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 63: |---|---|---|\\\\n 64: | `internal/provider/unified/module.go` | unified 总装配 | `EventDispatcher`、`SessionManager`、`Client` |\\\\n 65: | `internal/provider/unified/client.go` | thread 的 `SessionStarter` 适配 | `StartSession` / `ResumeSession` 统一入口 |\\\\n 66: | `internal/provider/unified/session.go` | in-memory session registry | register / generation / close all |\\\\n 67: | `internal/provider/unified/session_resolver.go` | durable binding -> auto resume | app 重启后 session 重建 |\\\\n 68: | `internal/provider/unified/event_map.go` | raw -> typed event 发布 | `typedEventPublishers`、`Dispatch()` |\\\\n 69: | `internal/provider/claudecli/event_map.go` | Claude raw translator | `translateClaudeEvent` |\\\\n 70: | `internal/provider/codexapp/event_map.go` | Codex raw translator | `translateCodexEvent` |\\\\n 71: | `internal/platform/eventsurface/bind.go` | typed event -> RPC/UI method | `thread/started`、`turn/*`、`ui/thread/patch` |\\\\n 72: \\\\n 73: ### 3.4 Frontend blank-thread 文件图\\\\n 74: \\\\n 75: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\\\n 76: |---|---|---|\\\\n 77: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/composables/useThreadActions.js` | 首发 send orchestration | `resolveStartOptions()` + `performSend()` |\\\\n 78: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/stores/thread-actions-helpers.js` | `thread/start` / `turn/start` 客户端 | `startThread()`、`sendMessage()` |\\\\n 79: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/components/ComposerBar.js` | composer UI | 输入、附件、发送、停止、压缩与线程配置；不再展示聊天内技能建议 |\\\\n 80: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/pages/UnifiedChatPage.template.js` | chat/workspace 模板 | composer、timeline、diff、task handoff 装配 |\\\\n 81: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/services/skills-api.js` | local skill write/import + resolution RPC | cwd-aware skill 管理、mirror conflict actions |\\\\n 82: \\\\n 83: ### 3.5 三个容易误读的“缺席真值”\\\\n 84: \\\\n 85: | 主题 | 真相 | 锚点 |\\\\n 86: |---|---|---|\\\\n 87: | `resolveTurnPromptAssembly` | 仓内无此符号；真实入口是 `turn.prepareTurnAssembly()` | `lsp_grep internal resolveTurnPromptAssembly = 0`；`internal/module/turn/prompt_assembly.go:13-43` |\\\\n 88: | `resume.go` | thread 包无独立实现文件；resume 逻辑拆在 `rpc.go + lifecycle.go + start_session.go + prompt_snapshot.go` | `find internal/module/thread ...` 文件树；`internal/module/thread/rpc.go:308-333` |\\\\n 89: | 旧独立 skill-catalog fx 文件 | 已删除；当前承载点并入 `prompt/module.go:14-26` | `internal/module/prompt/module.go:14-26` |\\\\n 90: \\\\n 91: ## 4. Prompt 主链\\\\n 92: \\\\n 93: ### 4.1 Prompt 模块装配入口\\\\n 94: \\\\n 95: - `internal/module/prompt/module.go:14-27` 定义 `prompt.Module`。\\\\n 96: - `fx.Provide(...)` 里同时放入：\\\\n 97:   - `NewConfig`\\\\n 98:   - `NewServiceFx`\\\\n 99:   - `AsPromptRegistry`\\\\n100:   - `AsPromptAssemblyService`\\\\n101:   - `AsDynamicSectionRegistrar`\\\\n102:   - `AsSectionInvalidator`\\\\n103:   - `registerPromptHandlers`\\\\n104: - `newPromptClassifier`\\\\n105: - `ServiceFxParams` 当前只接入 prompt config、logger、UI preference store、shared-file reader 和可选 `DisabledToolsFn`；没有 skill store 接线。\\\\n106: - `DisabledToolsFn` 只把用户禁用工具配置传给 prompt assembler，作为 native/tool suppression hints 的当前来源。\\\\n107: - 也就是说，**section slot 的“定义”与 provider 的“注入”是两段式**：\\\\n108:   1. `NewService()` 先注册静态 section + dynamic slot。\\\\n109:   2. 各 provider 再通过 `RegisterDynamicProvider()` 把实现挂到 slot 名上。\\\\n110: \\\\n111: ### 4.2 Registry 与 built-in provider 的组装方式\\\\n112: \\\\n113: - `internal/module/prompt/service.go:118-144` 的 `NewService()` 会：\\\\n114:   - 初始化 `SectionRegistry`\\\\n115:   - 初始化 section cache / userContext cache\\\\n116:   - 调 `registerBuiltInSections()`\\\\n117:   - 用 `mustRegisterDynamicProvider()` 注册 built-in dynamic providers\\\\n118: - `registerBuiltInSections()` 在 `service.go:344-350`：\\\\n119:   - 先注册 `StaticSections()`\\\\n120:   - 再注册 `dynamicSlotSections()`\\\\n121: - `SectionRegistry.Sections()` 在 `internal/module/prompt/registry.go:35-50`：\\\\n122:   - 按 `Order` 排序\\\\n123:   - 同 order 时按 `Name` 排序\\\\n124: - 这意味着：**最终 assembler 看到的是完整有序 section 列表，不是写死在 assembler.go 里的 if/else**。\\\\n125: \\\\n126: ### 4.3 Static sections：固定骨架\\\\n127: \\\\n128: `internal/module/prompt/section.go:24-32` 当前 static matrix 如下：\\\\n129: \\\\n130: | order | name | 说明 |\\\\n131: |---|---|---|\\\\n132: | 10 | `identity` | agent 身份与默认定位 |\\\\n133: | 20 | `system_constraints` | 系统约束 |\\\\n134: | 30 | `engineering` | 工程规则 |\\\\n135: | 40 | `actions` | 动作规范 |\\\\n136: | 50 | `tool_preferences` | 仓库内优先用 LSP / code tools |\\\\n137: | 60 | `style` | 风格约束 |\\\\n138: | 70 | `output_efficiency` | 输出效率约束 |\\\\n139: \\\\n140: 这 7 个 static section 会进入 start assembly。\\\\n141: \\\\n142: ### 4.4 Dynamic sections：真实 slot 矩阵\\\\n143: \\\\n144: `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:43-61` 当前真实 dynamic matrix 如下。\\\\n145: \\\\n146: | order | name | cachePolicy | startOnly | 生产 provider 入口 |\\\\n147: |---|---|---|---|---|\\\\n148: | 110 | `session_guidance` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `SessionGuidanceProvider`，`service.go:131` |\\\\n149: | 120 | `memory` | `InputScoped` | 是 | `MemoryRulesProvider`，memory 模块注册 |\\\\n150: | 122 | `memory_entrypoint` | `InputScoped` | 是 | memory entrypoint provider |\\\\n151: | 125 | `memory_context` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `MemoryContextProvider`，turn lane |\\\\n152: | 130 | `env_info_simple` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `EnvInfoProvider`，`service.go:132` |\\\\n153: | 140 | `language` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `LanguageProvider`，`service.go:133` |\\\\n154: | 150 | `mcp_instructions` | `Uncached` | 否 | `MCPInstructionsProvider`，`service.go:134` |\\\\n155: | 200 | `output_style` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `OutputStyleProvider`，`service.go:135` |\\\\n156: | 210 | `scratchpad` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `ScratchpadProvider`，`service.go:136` |\\\\n157: | 220 | `frc` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `FRCProvider`，`service.go:137` |\\\\n158: | 230 | `summarize_tool_results` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `SummarizeToolResultsProvider`，`service.go:138` |\\\\n159: | 240 | `numeric_length_anchors` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `NumericLengthAnchorsProvider`，`service.go:139` |\\\\n160: | 250 | `token_budget` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `TokenBudgetProvider`，`service.go:140` |\\\\n161: | 260 | `brief` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `BriefProvider`，`service.go:141` |\\\\n162: | 270 | `ant_model_override` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `AntModelOverrideStubProvider`，`service.go` |\\\\n163: \\\\n164: 结论：**这不是“固定 5 个 dynamic slot”**。旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表 slot 已退出生产链，skills 通过 provider-native mirrors 让 Claude/Codex 自己发现。\\\\n165: \\\\n166: ### 4.5 `dynamicSlotSections()` 如何把 slot 变成真正 section\\\\n167: \\\\n168: - `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:333-352` 的 `dynamicSlotSections()` 遍历 `dynamicSectionSpecs`。\\\\n169: - 每个 spec 都被映射成一个 `PromptSection`：\\\\n170:   - `Name = spec.name`\\\\n171:   - `Order = spec.order`\\\\n172:   - `Region = PromptRegionDynamic`\\\\n173:   - `Volatile = spec.cachePolicy == Uncached`\\\\n174:   - `StartOnly = spec.startOnly`\\\\n175:   - `Compute = s.resolveDynamicSection(...)`\\\\n176: - `resolveDynamicSection()` 在 `dynamic.go:355-363`：\\\\n177:   - 只按名字从 `s.dynamic` map 取 provider\\\\n178:   - provider 为 nil 时直接返回 nil\\\\n179: - 所以即使 slot 已存在，只要 provider 没注册，**该 section 仍会渲染为空**。\\\\n180: - 旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表已不在 slot 矩阵内；新增 dynamic provider 仍遵循“slot 注册 + provider 解析”的通用模式。\\\\n\\\\n...[showing lines 1-180 of 1436 total, use offset=181 to continue]\\\"}\",\"structuredContent\":{\"value\":\"  1: # 11B Prompt / Thread 代码地图\\n  2: \\n  3: > 拆卷说明：本卷只覆盖 `internal/module/prompt/`、`internal/module/thread/`、provider bridge、以及 blank-thread 首发链；memory 深水区另见 [`11-memory.md`](11-memory.md)。\\n  4: > 当前口径：以 2026-04-20 HEAD 为准；用于收口 prompt / thread / provider `start / resume / fork`、prompt store、snapshot、以及前端 blank-thread 首发真值。\\n  5: > 必读搭配：`docs/会话习惯.md` §10.21 / §10.25；shared patches：`tmp/codemap-missing-coverage.md`、`tmp/codemap-mermaid-patches.md`、`tmp/codemap-test-freeze.md`、`tmp/codemap-howto-patches.md`。\\n  6: \\n  7: ## 1. 这卷回答什么\\n  8: \\n  9: - `thread/start` 到 provider `StartSession` 之间，**system prompt 是怎样组装、下发、落盘**的。\\n 10: - `PROMPT_START_CURRENT_DATE`、dynamic sections、memory providers、native-tool replacement hints，**分别插在哪个层级**。\\n 11: - `thread/resume` / `thread/fork` / `thread/recover` 时，**prompt snapshot 与 runtime config snapshot 各自如何复用**。\\n 12: - provider raw event 经过 unified event map、session manager、thread 订阅、eventsurface，**最终怎样变成 UI 可见事件**。\\n 13: - blank-thread 首发时，前端为什么一定是 **`resolveStartOptions -> startThread -> sendMessage`** 两段式，而不是一次 RPC 直发。\\n 14: \\n 15: ## 2. 当前源码结论\\n 16: \\n 17: 1. **start prompt 的正式入口不在 prompt 包里单独命名，而在 thread helper**：`internal/module/thread/start_session_helpers.go:82-94` 的 `resolveStartPromptAssembly()` 调 `PromptAssemblyRef.AssembleStart()`。\\n 18: 2. **turn prompt 没有同名 helper**：仓内 `resolveTurnPromptAssembly` 为 0 命中；turn 侧真实入口是 `internal/module/turn/prompt_assembly.go:13-43` 的 `prepareTurnAssembly()`，再调 `prompt.AssembleTurn()`。\\n 19: 3. **`PROMPT_START_CURRENT_DATE` 已上线且只影响 start 一次性 system block**：常量在 `internal/module/prompt/assembler.go:25`，读 env 在 `:289-291`，注入 “Today's date is ...” 在 `:273`。\\n 20: 4. **dynamic section 不是固定 5 个 slot**：真实矩阵来自 `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:43-61`，当前不含旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表 slot。\\n 21: 5. **skill 不再经 prompt catalog 注入**：V1 生产路径是 canonical skills -> provider-native mirrors；prompt 不从 skill store 读取 native replacement，native/tool suppression hints 只来自用户禁用工具配置。\\n 22: 6. **prompt config 不再承载旧 skill 列表开关**：`internal/module/prompt/config.go` 只保留 registry / assembly / system-context cache breaker 等 prompt 开关。\\n 23: 7. **prompt store 不是只读**：`internal/store/prompt/contract.go:15-22` 已暴露 `WithTx / Get / Delete / InsertVersion / Upsert`；写路径在 `internal/module/prompt/service.go:290-340,382-488`。\\n 24: 8. **freeze 真值是 `prompt = 27`**：`internal/archtest/freeze_registry.go:29-35` 明写 `internal/module/prompt` 包文件数 freeze 到 27。\\n 25: 9. **resume 没有独立 `resume.go`**：resume 主链分散在 `thread/lifecycle.go`、`start_session.go`、`prompt_snapshot.go`、`rpc.go`；文件树里只有 `resume_test.go`、`resume_session_uuid_test.go`。\\n 26: 10. **memory 与 prompt 的交点不是共用一个 snapshot 结构**：prompt snapshot 单独存 `agent_thread_prompt_snapshot`；memory 侧读的是 thread `ConfigOverride.Runtime`，由 `MemoryLifecycleHooks.resolveThreadRuntimeMetadata()` 解释。\\n 27: 11. **provider bridge 的主干是 bus，不是 thread 直接监听 driver**：driver session 只 dispatch raw event；统一翻译发生在 `internal/provider/unified/event_map.go:71-124`；thread 只订阅 bus 上的 typed event。\\n 28: 12. **blank-thread 首发天然是两跳**：前端先 `thread/start` 拿 thread id，再 `turn/start` 发用户输入；这保证 start-only prompt 只在创线时注入一次。\\n 29: \\n 30: ## 3. 文件与入口索引\\n 31: \\n 32: ### 3.1 Prompt 侧文件图\\n 33: \\n 34: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\n 35: |---|---|---|\\n 36: | `internal/module/prompt/module.go` | fx 装配、prompt service wiring | `Module`、`NewServiceFx`、`DisabledToolsFn` optional injection |\\n 37: | `internal/module/prompt/config.go` | env config | registry / assembly / system-context cache breaker |\\n 38: | `internal/module/prompt/service.go` | registry + prompt CRUD service | built-in providers、prompt store 写入口 |\\n 39: | `internal/module/prompt/assembler.go` | start/turn assembly 真身 | start system prompt、current date hook、snapshot 生成 |\\n 40: | `internal/module/prompt/section.go` | static section specs | static slots 真实列表 |\\n 41: | `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go` | dynamic slot 矩阵 | dynamic section specs、slot -> provider 解析 |\\n 42: | `internal/module/prompt/registry.go` | ordered section registry | `Sections()` 按 `Order` 输出 |\\n 43: \\n 44: ### 3.2 Thread 侧文件图\\n 45: \\n 46: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\n 47: |---|---|---|\\n 48: | `internal/module/thread/contract.go` | service contract / DTO | `StartRequest`、`ResumeRequest`、`PromptSnapshot` 字段 |\\n 49: | `internal/module/thread/rpc.go` | `thread/*` RPC handlers | `thread/start`、`thread/resume`、`thread/fork` |\\n 50: | `internal/module/thread/lifecycle.go` | `Start / Resume` service 主链 | launch、persist、save prompt snapshot |\\n 51: | `internal/module/thread/start_prompt_context.go` | start BuildCtx 组装 | cwd / gitRoot / MCP / session flags 注入 |\\n 52: | `internal/module/thread/start_session_helpers.go` | start helper | `resolveStartPromptAssembly`、`buildStartSessionConfig` |\\n 53: | `internal/module/thread/start_session.go` | provider DTO 物化 | `StartSession` / `ResumeSession` 请求拼装 |\\n 54: | `internal/module/thread/prompt_snapshot.go` | snapshot 持久化与恢复 | hash、load/save、resume/fork fallback |\\n 55: | `internal/module/thread/lifecycle_fork.go` | `Fork / Recover` | stable snapshot 继承、resume reuse |\\n 56: | `internal/module/thread/factory.go` | offline/runtime config snapshot | `storedThreadConfig` encode/decode |\\n 57: | `internal/module/thread/events.go` | thread 订阅 provider lifecycle | `onAgentLaunched`、`onAgentFailed` |\\n 58: | `internal/module/thread/module.go` | fx wiring | `registerSubscriptions` |\\n 59: \\n 60: ### 3.3 Provider bridge 侧文件图\\n 61: \\n 62: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\n 63: |---|---|---|\\n 64: | `internal/provider/unified/module.go` | unified 总装配 | `EventDispatcher`、`SessionManager`、`Client` |\\n 65: | `internal/provider/unified/client.go` | thread 的 `SessionStarter` 适配 | `StartSession` / `ResumeSession` 统一入口 |\\n 66: | `internal/provider/unified/session.go` | in-memory session registry | register / generation / close all |\\n 67: | `internal/provider/unified/session_resolver.go` | durable binding -> auto resume | app 重启后 session 重建 |\\n 68: | `internal/provider/unified/event_map.go` | raw -> typed event 发布 | `typedEventPublishers`、`Dispatch()` |\\n 69: | `internal/provider/claudecli/event_map.go` | Claude raw translator | `translateClaudeEvent` |\\n 70: | `internal/provider/codexapp/event_map.go` | Codex raw translator | `translateCodexEvent` |\\n 71: | `internal/platform/eventsurface/bind.go` | typed event -> RPC/UI method | `thread/started`、`turn/*`、`ui/thread/patch` |\\n 72: \\n 73: ### 3.4 Frontend blank-thread 文件图\\n 74: \\n 75: | 路径 | 角色 | 本卷重点 |\\n 76: |---|---|---|\\n 77: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/composables/useThreadActions.js` | 首发 send orchestration | `resolveStartOptions()` + `performSend()` |\\n 78: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/stores/thread-actions-helpers.js` | `thread/start` / `turn/start` 客户端 | `startThread()`、`sendMessage()` |\\n 79: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/components/ComposerBar.js` | composer UI | 输入、附件、发送、停止、压缩与线程配置；不再展示聊天内技能建议 |\\n 80: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/pages/UnifiedChatPage.template.js` | chat/workspace 模板 | composer、timeline、diff、task handoff 装配 |\\n 81: | `cmd/agent-terminal/frontend/vue-app/services/skills-api.js` | local skill write/import + resolution RPC | cwd-aware skill 管理、mirror conflict actions |\\n 82: \\n 83: ### 3.5 三个容易误读的“缺席真值”\\n 84: \\n 85: | 主题 | 真相 | 锚点 |\\n 86: |---|---|---|\\n 87: | `resolveTurnPromptAssembly` | 仓内无此符号；真实入口是 `turn.prepareTurnAssembly()` | `lsp_grep internal resolveTurnPromptAssembly = 0`；`internal/module/turn/prompt_assembly.go:13-43` |\\n 88: | `resume.go` | thread 包无独立实现文件；resume 逻辑拆在 `rpc.go + lifecycle.go + start_session.go + prompt_snapshot.go` | `find internal/module/thread ...` 文件树；`internal/module/thread/rpc.go:308-333` |\\n 89: | 旧独立 skill-catalog fx 文件 | 已删除；当前承载点并入 `prompt/module.go:14-26` | `internal/module/prompt/module.go:14-26` |\\n 90: \\n 91: ## 4. Prompt 主链\\n 92: \\n 93: ### 4.1 Prompt 模块装配入口\\n 94: \\n 95: - `internal/module/prompt/module.go:14-27` 定义 `prompt.Module`。\\n 96: - `fx.Provide(...)` 里同时放入：\\n 97:   - `NewConfig`\\n 98:   - `NewServiceFx`\\n 99:   - `AsPromptRegistry`\\n100:   - `AsPromptAssemblyService`\\n101:   - `AsDynamicSectionRegistrar`\\n102:   - `AsSectionInvalidator`\\n103:   - `registerPromptHandlers`\\n104: - `newPromptClassifier`\\n105: - `ServiceFxParams` 当前只接入 prompt config、logger、UI preference store、shared-file reader 和可选 `DisabledToolsFn`；没有 skill store 接线。\\n106: - `DisabledToolsFn` 只把用户禁用工具配置传给 prompt assembler，作为 native/tool suppression hints 的当前来源。\\n107: - 也就是说，**section slot 的“定义”与 provider 的“注入”是两段式**：\\n108:   1. `NewService()` 先注册静态 section + dynamic slot。\\n109:   2. 各 provider 再通过 `RegisterDynamicProvider()` 把实现挂到 slot 名上。\\n110: \\n111: ### 4.2 Registry 与 built-in provider 的组装方式\\n112: \\n113: - `internal/module/prompt/service.go:118-144` 的 `NewService()` 会：\\n114:   - 初始化 `SectionRegistry`\\n115:   - 初始化 section cache / userContext cache\\n116:   - 调 `registerBuiltInSections()`\\n117:   - 用 `mustRegisterDynamicProvider()` 注册 built-in dynamic providers\\n118: - `registerBuiltInSections()` 在 `service.go:344-350`：\\n119:   - 先注册 `StaticSections()`\\n120:   - 再注册 `dynamicSlotSections()`\\n121: - `SectionRegistry.Sections()` 在 `internal/module/prompt/registry.go:35-50`：\\n122:   - 按 `Order` 排序\\n123:   - 同 order 时按 `Name` 排序\\n124: - 这意味着：**最终 assembler 看到的是完整有序 section 列表，不是写死在 assembler.go 里的 if/else**。\\n125: \\n126: ### 4.3 Static sections：固定骨架\\n127: \\n128: `internal/module/prompt/section.go:24-32` 当前 static matrix 如下：\\n129: \\n130: | order | name | 说明 |\\n131: |---|---|---|\\n132: | 10 | `identity` | agent 身份与默认定位 |\\n133: | 20 | `system_constraints` | 系统约束 |\\n134: | 30 | `engineering` | 工程规则 |\\n135: | 40 | `actions` | 动作规范 |\\n136: | 50 | `tool_preferences` | 仓库内优先用 LSP / code tools |\\n137: | 60 | `style` | 风格约束 |\\n138: | 70 | `output_efficiency` | 输出效率约束 |\\n139: \\n140: 这 7 个 static section 会进入 start assembly。\\n141: \\n142: ### 4.4 Dynamic sections：真实 slot 矩阵\\n143: \\n144: `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:43-61` 当前真实 dynamic matrix 如下。\\n145: \\n146: | order | name | cachePolicy | startOnly | 生产 provider 入口 |\\n147: |---|---|---|---|---|\\n148: | 110 | `session_guidance` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `SessionGuidanceProvider`，`service.go:131` |\\n149: | 120 | `memory` | `InputScoped` | 是 | `MemoryRulesProvider`，memory 模块注册 |\\n150: | 122 | `memory_entrypoint` | `InputScoped` | 是 | memory entrypoint provider |\\n151: | 125 | `memory_context` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `MemoryContextProvider`，turn lane |\\n152: | 130 | `env_info_simple` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `EnvInfoProvider`，`service.go:132` |\\n153: | 140 | `language` | `InputScoped` | 否 | `LanguageProvider`，`service.go:133` |\\n154: | 150 | `mcp_instructions` | `Uncached` | 否 | `MCPInstructionsProvider`，`service.go:134` |\\n155: | 200 | `output_style` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `OutputStyleProvider`，`service.go:135` |\\n156: | 210 | `scratchpad` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `ScratchpadProvider`，`service.go:136` |\\n157: | 220 | `frc` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `FRCProvider`，`service.go:137` |\\n158: | 230 | `summarize_tool_results` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `SummarizeToolResultsProvider`，`service.go:138` |\\n159: | 240 | `numeric_length_anchors` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `NumericLengthAnchorsProvider`，`service.go:139` |\\n160: | 250 | `token_budget` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `TokenBudgetProvider`，`service.go:140` |\\n161: | 260 | `brief` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `BriefProvider`，`service.go:141` |\\n162: | 270 | `ant_model_override` | `CacheByName` | 否 | `AntModelOverrideStubProvider`，`service.go` |\\n163: \\n164: 结论：**这不是“固定 5 个 dynamic slot”**。旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表 slot 已退出生产链，skills 通过 provider-native mirrors 让 Claude/Codex 自己发现。\\n165: \\n166: ### 4.5 `dynamicSlotSections()` 如何把 slot 变成真正 section\\n167: \\n168: - `internal/module/prompt/dynamic.go:333-352` 的 `dynamicSlotSections()` 遍历 `dynamicSectionSpecs`。\\n169: - 每个 spec 都被映射成一个 `PromptSection`：\\n170:   - `Name = spec.name`\\n171:   - `Order = spec.order`\\n172:   - `Region = PromptRegionDynamic`\\n173:   - `Volatile = spec.cachePolicy == Uncached`\\n174:   - `StartOnly = spec.startOnly`\\n175:   - `Compute = s.resolveDynamicSection(...)`\\n176: - `resolveDynamicSection()` 在 `dynamic.go:355-363`：\\n177:   - 只按名字从 `s.dynamic` map 取 provider\\n178:   - provider 为 nil 时直接返回 nil\\n179: - 所以即使 slot 已存在，只要 provider 没注册，**该 section 仍会渲染为空**。\\n180: - 旧 prompt 注入式 skill 列表已不在 slot 矩阵内；新增 dynamic provider 仍遵循“slot 注册 + provider 解析”的通用模式。\\n\\n...[showing lines 1-180 of 1436 total, use offset=181 to continue]\"}}}"}
